BE IT ORDAINED BY THE CITY COUNCIL OF THE CITY OF CHICAGO:

ORDINANCE

SECTION 1. That the Chicago Zoning Ordinance be amended by changing all of the M1-2
Manufacturing/Business Park District and C2-2 Motor Vehicle Related Commercial District symbols and
indications as shown on Map 6-K in the area bounded by:

Keeler Avenue;

a line measuring 264.98 feet south of Ogden Avenue along the coordinate measuring
north 01°37'26” west;

a line 5.28 feet east of and parallel to Keeler Avenue;

a line 264.23 feet south of Ogden Avenue;

a line commencing at a point 227.02 feet east of Keeler Avenue, and extending south
42.11 feet along the arc of a circle having a radius of 52.5 feet concave easterly and
whose chord bears north 21°21'16" east a distance of 40.99 feet;

a line extending 42.10 feet along the arc of a circle having a radius of 52.5 feet concave
westerly and whose chord bears north 21°21'35" east a distance of 40.98 feet;

a line extending south 61.80 feet;

a line extending south 41.15 feet along the arc of a circle having a radius of 50 feet
concave easterly and whose chord bears north 21°57'16" east a distance of 40 feet;

a line south 56.5 feet;

Chicago Burlington & Quincy Railroad;

a line 418.16 feet southwest of and extending from Pulaski Road;

a line 25 feet north of and parallel to Chicago Burlington & Quincy Railroad;

Pulaski Road;

a line 125 feet north of the north property line of Chicago Burlington & Quincy Railroad
and perpendicular to Pulaski Road;

a line 181.50 feet west of and parallel to Pulaski Road;

and Ogden Avenue.

Except for the following parcel:
a line 20.15 feet north of and parallel to Chicago Burlington & Quincy Railroad;

a line extending a distance of 40 feet north along the coordinate measuring south
01°34'14" east;
